{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "BSB",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 22,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the choirmaster. To the tune of “The Doe of the Dawn.” A Psalm of David. My God, my God, why have You forsaken me? Why are You so far from saving me, so far from my words of groaning?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I cry out by day, O my God, but You do not answer, and by night, but I have no rest.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Yet You are holy, enthroned on the praises of Israel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In You our fathers trusted; they trusted and You delivered them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They cried out to You and were set free; they trusted in You and were not disappointed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But I am a worm and not a man, scorned by men and despised by the people.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "All who see me mock me; they sneer and shake their heads:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "“He trusts in the LORD, let the LORD deliver him; let the LORD rescue him, since He delights in him.”",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Yet You brought me forth from the womb; You made me secure at my mother’s breast.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "From birth I was cast upon You; from my mother’s womb You have been my God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Be not far from me, for trouble is near and there is no one to help.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Many bulls surround me; strong bulls of Bashan encircle me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They open their jaws against me like lions that roar and maul.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I am poured out like water, and all my bones are disjointed. My heart is like wax; it melts away within me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My strength is dried up like a potsherd, and my tongue sticks to the roof of my mouth. You lay me in the dust of death.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For dogs surround me; a band of evil men encircles me; they have pierced my hands and feet.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I can count all my bones; they stare and gloat over me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They divide my garments among them and cast lots for my clothing.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But You, O LORD, be not far off; O my Strength, come quickly to help me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Deliver my soul from the sword, my precious life from the power of wild dogs.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Save me from the mouth of the lion; at the horns of the wild oxen You have answered me!",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will proclaim Your name to my brothers; I will praise You in the assembly.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "You who fear the LORD, praise Him! All descendants of Jacob, honor Him! All offspring of Israel, revere Him!",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For He has not despised or detested the torment of the afflicted. He has not hidden His face from him, but has attended to his cry for help.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My praise for You resounds in the great assembly; I will fulfill my vows before those who fear You.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The poor will eat and be satisfied; those who seek the LORD will praise Him. May your hearts live forever!",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "All the ends of the earth will remember and turn to the LORD. All the families of the nations will bow down before Him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For dominion belongs to the LORD and He rules over the nations.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "All the rich of the earth will feast and worship; all who go down to the dust will kneel before Him— even those unable to preserve their lives.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Posterity will serve Him; they will declare the Lord to a new generation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.22.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They will come and proclaim His righteousness to a people yet unborn — all that He has done.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
